abstract: >-
  A reproducible Nextflow DSL2 workflow for human bulk RNA-seq, ATAC-seq,
  conventional WGBS, H3K27ac ChIP-seq, regulatory-evidence integration,
  offline reporting, provenance, and external validation on GRCh38 with
  GENCODE release 50.
